<div class="centered">
  <h1 class="page-header-text">404 - Page Not Found</h1>
  <p>The page you are looking for doesn't exist or has been moved.
  Try adding a <code>#</code> in front of the last part of the url if it's a header anchor.
  Most old links should be redirected to the new ones automatically.
  </p>
  <p>Example: <code>{{ '/docs/matugen/installation/nixos' | url }}</code> -> <code>{{ '/docs/matugen/installation/#nixos' | url }}</code></p>
  <a href="{{ '/' | url }}" class="btn btn-filled">Back to Home</a>
</div>
